00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.860
and then sent my attorneys something called a declination letter

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.780
declining to prosecute me.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:20.500
They said that I hadn't violated the law and they just moved on.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.860
Huh, interesting.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:27.060
Yeah, three weeks later, Barack Obama becomes president.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.620
