00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:48.820
So over the next three years, my phones were tapped.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.020
My emails were being intercepted.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:54.540
Teams of FBI agents were conducting surveillance on me.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:09:00.060
