00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.860
they arrested me and they charged me with five felonies,

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:08.060
including three counts of espionage coming out of that ABC News interview.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.180
Yeah, I hadn't committed espionage.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.620
And they dropped the charges eventually.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:15.740
But what happened was, and we got this in discovery,

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:21.020
Brennan wrote a letter to Holder and said, charge him with espionage.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.820
And Holder wrote back and said, my people don't think he committed espionage.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:27.020
And then Brennan wrote back to Holder and said,

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.420
