00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.340
So they did.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:35.820
And then they waited until I went bankrupt from attorney's fees.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.540
And then they dropped the charges.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.020
That's that's what they do.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:40.620
They bankrupt people.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.180
But they do.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:46.020
But what a waste of resources to watch you for three years.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.540
Oh, it cost millions of dollars.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:53.500
We did a FOIA request during the course of the trial

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.260
