00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.780
And it was over six million dollars.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.940
And it's like, you know, was that really an appropriate use of the taxpayer's money?

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:10.180
Is society safer and better off because you spent six million dollars

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.540
to put me in a low security prison for 23 months?

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:15.700
Really? Or was that just revenge?

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.780
And it was revenge. Yeah.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.860
It was obvious now.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:23.980
But what what was weird is that there were leaks all over the place

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.740
