00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.460
They just decided to nail you.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:32.300
You know, nobody brings that up, but you are exactly right.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:37.460
One of the reasons why the FBI elected to not refer me for prosecution

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.980
in 2008 was that.

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:46.460
Amnesty International had already written a report saying the CIA was torturing its prisoners.

