Oh, my God, you go to any African country and the Chinese are all over the place,

00:47:33.340 --> 00:47:37.900
building roads and schools and hospitals and ports and airports and

00:47:38.100 --> 00:47:44.380
universities and a Congolese diplomat once told me,

00:47:44.580 --> 00:47:47.460
