Like, well, now what do we do?

00:49:46.260 --> 00:49:48.460
The Chinese own all our ports.

00:49:48.660 --> 00:49:50.220
We're slaves to the Chinese.

00:49:50.220 --> 00:49:51.820
It's like you are.

